          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <div class="bg-green-100 rounded-full p-1 mr-3 mt-1">
                <svg
                  class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 20 20"
